      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>of the pilgrimage. People will call out but no one will respond.</li>\n<li>People will experience illnesses: inflammation, coughing,</li>\n<li>smallpox and ophthalmia. Fish and pressed goods (juices and oils) will be abundant</li>\n<li>and will be healthy, but olives will be scarce. Some</li>\n<li>fruits will be blighted. Rain will be abundant,</li>\n<li>as will snakes. Smallpox will spread among the old</li>\n<li>and the young. Figs and grapes will be abundant, and the date palms</li>\n<li>will be healthy. There will be profit in flax. An affliction will fall on Alexandria</li>\n<li>and the Maghrib, and wild beasts and pigs will die.</li>\n<li>Many ships will sink in the Mediterranean.</li>\n<li>At the end of the year there will be abundance, but</li>\n<li>clover and legumes will be blighted. God knows best</li>\n<li>what is hidden.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If the new year</li>\n<li>falls in Leo, if Sirius rises on</li>\n<li>day 25 of Ab\u012bb, and [the moon] is lodged in Leo,</li>\n<li>then it indicates what will be in it: blowing of wind</li>\n<li>from the west lasting for days. There will sink in ...</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
